      "velocity shaping applied to flat lane(s): snare(38), shaker(82) (grid formula; varied lanes keep source velocities)",
      "bar 2 variation: closed hat at step 28 converted to open hat (end-of-bar open hat)",
      "fill: snare density ramp (8ths to 16ths) + tom run 48/45/43 + crash 49 on last cell",
      "v2 (2026-11-18): renamed Acoustic Rock; kit stays Programs/01-basic-kit.sfz - Programs/02-full-kit.sfz (8902 regions) cannot voice this pattern today: its keymap puts the hi-hat on key 42 under CC4 pedal control and has no regions on key 46 (probed 2026-11-18), so the open-hat hits would be silent; full-kit adoption is a separate gap line. Differentiation vs Acoustic Pop is in FX: tape saturation, long room reverb (size 0.80) with 38 ms predelay, harder track compression"
